        "created_at": "2015-05-01T14:01:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That's pretty sweet. &nbsp;I don't know that I've ever gone into a fight with Scholar thinking he would be the main damage dealer. &nbsp;I like to think he gets his hits in where he can. &nbsp; CR with that setup would ramp up quickly and wiht little fear of extra damage from Hunter and Hunted just makes him more deadly. &nbsp;</p>",
