        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/3ec8ea/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-05-01T17:25:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've had a couple of games where I pushed Scholar into doing more beatdown then tanking. Often it occurs if someone else grabs the reins as far as taking hits.</p><p>With the right set up and some external healing, he can be a machine.... gun. :)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The main problem is it takes 3 Elemental cards to make it really shine, where as you can get by as a tank with one. With two energies and one liquid, however..... Add in some amps from Legacy, or the lovely, for this, Phosphorescent Chamber and things go nuts.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:18:06.189Z",
