        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-05-07T16:45:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Grand Warlord Voss, scourge of the space, was recently schooled by a blind auto mechanic. Mr. Fixer was cheered on by Visionary and Grandpa Paul. Fanatic and Unity also helped.</p><p>This was a case of duel crowbars, ToE, Inspired Presence, Harmony, and Grease Monkey Fist combining with Gung Ho into two instances of 5 points of damage and two instances of 9 points of damage a round. Everything else was pretty much bonus.</p>",
